                                "sense_id": "c29f635d-30bd-3e2e-9555-275c4be56f1e",
                                "text": "When Laura tells Bart that she can teach him to dance, Bart and Laura are suddenly transformed into Astaire and Rogers in a black-and-white fantasy sequence before Bart’s reverie is abruptly ended when Laura reverts back to bratty tomboy form and gives him a wedgie."
